Package: statsnzade
Title: Search and Extract Data from the Stats NZ Aotearoa Data Explorer
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Eugene", "Isack", , "eisack@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Search, browse and extract data and metadata from Stats
    NZ's 'Aotearoa Data Explorer' ('ADE') 'SDMX' REST API
    (<https://explore.data.stats.govt.nz/>). Provides
    functions to list available datasets, inspect their dimensions and
    codelists, and download data, in the spirit of packages such as
    'OECD' and 'rsdmx'. Dataset and dimension metadata is cached locally
    as a lightweight database so that repeated lookups do not require
    repeated API calls.
